  "title": "Delete credential"
 },
 "description": "Permanently delete one stored credential, which can break every referencing workflow. credentialId must be the stable ID from n8n_credentials_list, get, or create; a credential name or type is not accepted. Scan all n8n_credentials_usage pages first, or update when replacement is enough. No secret or rollback is returned. Requires unsafe mode plus credential-delete permission; returns the request-bound credentialId with deleted=true.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
